<description>&lt;p&gt;Jihadist groups JNIM and ISSP continue to clash in northern Burkina Faso as the state loses ground, while bandits in Niger State killed two kidnapping victims despite a six-million-naira ransom. Armed men attacked civilians in a Niger flashpoint, killing dozens, and an armed attack near Niger's western border left at least 38 dead. In Mali, 300 Russians, likely Wagner and Africa Corps mercenaries, were killed, and thousands of Arab nomads were ordered to leave southeast Niger. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPWmgyMDVHUGNCbVVQZC11ZEFVTk0wMzN4X2RrZE9lMXVOcm40MllHQnctdHluaGR6ZTJJQm1lS0lnUlhjWC1CdjFZUlY0akpETVNyMDFvTGhHWFFfV0VaRmZCdVBfM2o5OHVlZFFia1oydEl0eEFkNk5FM0N5Z3JXamN4YTAwUXNTQ0c0VTB5ZUlDSTNNbXdUX3Fac3BIT1dzbE56RA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Мілітарний&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxPZ28ta0Q5dlJhVGJLQ2JOQUctdkQ1T1VzbTA1TEhTWjBYVTZMdnV2LTRCZFd3bEZhcmtZTVg5STdSVDZDdlBkN3hwOTh4UjJYb3hBYkc0NlRSYUE4RjQyRFhJMFFJeEZCYkxlUm53N0VqQnl0X2xqeWZuRXFjV2xTMDJBZGdiUnhJVmpXcnVXQnJwVVd5eklhdVlkVENNZXJyTTRaVDRBRktqNVI5emhCcEtiOXpIYmJfRkhNWERzaW4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPck1idk1lUEtQcmZwQnhkLS1EZ3pKaVhEYWVDMERmODMtUUNEUDdqTVR6S2xZNEFxTTRkZm9aZ1Zueld2X0drWVpIQkt2TUZDeFgtTUU1UktyaF91X1piWFdZRnVXcTl1T25uNEZSTW9HV0MybUVUN1FlSWxOS1hTdE9xMlJrMmNTLWJhSHpPUmhvYWVJNm92YXpwSlVaUnRFdzV1SzgzZEVzNzN2WlZyQk13?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ahram Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com